  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><h2 data-lake-id=\"OUUfx\" id=\"OUUfx\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf669a808\" id=\"uf669a808\">QPushButton</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u49421a77\" id=\"u49421a77\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5691d7f0\" id=\"u5691d7f0\">常见的按钮实现类包括:</span><code data-lake-id=\"u5ef1c613\" id=\"u5ef1c613\"><span data-lake-id=\"u176f2548\" id=\"u176f2548\">QPushButton</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u160315e0\" id=\"u160315e0\">、</span><code data-lake-id=\"ua128e04f\" id=\"ua128e04f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u02dbda1b\" id=\"u02dbda1b\">QRadioButton</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ue24e8858\" id=\"ue24e8858\">和</span><code data-lake-id=\"uc05eb5b9\" id=\"uc05eb5b9\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc3ccaf49\" id=\"uc3ccaf49\">QCheckBox</span></code></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf1cfeb73\" id=\"uf1cfeb73\"><span data-lake-id=\"u95bfe765\" id=\"u95bfe765\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"ue310c5ce\" id=\"ue310c5ce\"><code data-lake-id=\"ubafccd48\" id=\"ubafccd48\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8af17201\" id=\"u8af17201\">QPushButton</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u0723e8f5\" id=\"u0723e8f5\">是最普通的按钮控件，可以响应一些用户的事件</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20PyQt5.QtWidgets%20import%20QApplication%2C%20QWidget%2C%20QPushButton%5Cnimport%20sys%5Cn%5Cn%5Cndef%20func()%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20print(%5C%22%E6%8C%89%E4%B8%8B%E6%8C%89%E9%92%AE%E5%95%A6%EF%BC%8C%E7%81%AB%E7%AE%AD%E5%8F%91%E5%B0%84%EF%BC%81%5C%22)%5Cn%5Cn%5Cn%23%201.%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%E5%BA%94%E7%94%A8%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%5Cnapp%20%3D%20QApplication(sys.argv)%5Cn%5Cn%23%202.%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%E7%AA%97%E5%8F%A3%5Cnw%20%3D%20QWidget()%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E7%AA%97%E5%8F%A3%E6%A0%87%E9%A2%98%5Cnw.setWindowTitle('%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E6%8C%89%E9%92%AE')%5Cn%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22------------------%20%E6%98%BE%E7%A4%BA%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E6%8C%89%E9%92%AE%20------------------%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cnbtn%20%3D%20QPushButton()%5Cn%23%20%E6%B7%BB%E5%8A%A0%E6%8C%89%E9%92%AE%E6%8F%90%E7%A4%BA%5Cnbtn.setText('%E5%8F%91%E5%B0%84')%5Cn%23%20%E7%BB%99%E6%8C%89%E9%92%AE%E6%B7%BB%E5%8A%A0%E7%82%B9%E5%87%BB%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6%5Cnbtn.clicked.connect(func)%5Cn%23%20%E5%B1%95%E7%A4%BA%E6%8C%89%E9%92%AE%5Cnbtn.setParent(w)%5Cn%5Cn%23%203.%E6%98%BE%E7%A4%BA%E7%AA%97%E5%8F%A3%5Cnw.show()%5Cn%5Cn%23%204.%E7%AD%89%E5%BE%85%E7%AA%97%E5%8F%A3%E5%81%9C%E6%AD%A2%5Cnsys.exit(app.exec())%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HAHeJ%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ud8b803bd\" id=\"ud8b803bd\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue5786f9f\" id=\"ue5786f9f\">运行程序:</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uebc5f499\" id=\"uebc5f499\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1685238007662-9a49c75f-6151-4549-b371-9bfdd759be41.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u66d1cf00-e4c6-4458-b9eb-a6c46c39959%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u20c21ab2-f4f5-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A513.6%2C%22height%22%3A422%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A22668%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A642%2C%22originHeight%22%3A527%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22search%22%3A%22%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E6%8C%89%E9%92%AE%20%E5%8F%91%E5%B0%84%20C%3A%5C%5CUSERS%5C%5CPOPLAR%5C%5CAPPDATA%5C%5CLOCAL%5C%5CPROGRAMS%5C%5CPYTHON%5C%5CPYTHON39%5C%5CPY%20%E6%8C%89%E4%B8%8B%E6%8C%89%E9%92%AE%E5%95%A6%2C%E7%81%AB%E7%AE%AD%E5%8F%91%E5%B0%84!%20%E6%8C%89%